 <header class="casino-hero"><div><span class="casino-eyebrow">LOCK DOWN · THE HOUSE</span><h1>Casino</h1><p>Play your hand. Know your limit.</p></div><span class="casino-emblem" aria-hidden="true">♠</span></header>
